blocks.en:
Implementation Details. FastVLM-1.5B uses FastViT-HD [ 18 ] and a Qwen2 LLM.
Inputs are padded to 1024 × 1024 1024\times 1024 , yielding 256 visual tokens;
VPRune prunes after the projector and before the LLM.
We report accuracy at b ∈ { 0.3 , 0.6 , 0.8 } b\in\{0.3,0.6,0.8\} and additionally use b = 0.1 b=0.1 for efficiency. Baselines are matched to the target ratios.
All runs use greedy decoding (batch size 1) without fine-tuning;
VPRune sets γ = 0.3 \gamma=0.3 and τ = 0.1 \tau=0.1 .

